      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this four-bedroom semi detached family home with extra large rear garden to the market at No. 56 Ballygall Road West, Finglas East.\n\nThis mature and highly sought-after location offers a wealth of amenities within easy reach, including the beautiful National Botanic Gardens, Albert College Park and Johnstown Park. Excellent recreational facilities are nearby such as Na Fianna GAA Club, Glasnevin Lawn Tennis Club and Tolka Rovers AFC. A variety of shopping options can be found close by, including Charlestown Shopping Centre and IKEA, while Finglas Village is within walking distance and offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, schools and local services.\n\nThe area is exceptionally well serviced by public transport, with a number of Dublin Bus routes located nearby providing quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The property also benefits from easy access to the M50 motorway, Dublin Airport and a host of major road networks.\n\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 86 sq.m comprises an entrance hallway, lounge, fully fitted kitchen with dining area, four spacious bedrooms and main family bathroom.\n\nThis fine family home boasts wraparound external insulation, gas fired central heating, light filled interior, off street parking to the front and an extra-large sunny rear garden with side entrance and storage sheds which offers endless opportunities and potential for its new owner.\n\nNo. 56 comes to the market in good condition throughout and offers spacious accommodation in a highly convenient location, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families and investors alike.\n\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 015411455 to arrange a viewing or register your interest.\n\nAdditional Features:\n• c. 86 sq.m\n• BER: C2\n• Extra large rear garden\n• Storage sheds and wide side entrance\n• Wraparound external insulation\n• CCTV system\n• Feature fireplace in lounge\n• Semi detached family home\n• Huge potential\n• Lounge to front and kitchen to rear\n• Light filled interior\n• Off street parking to the front\n• Gas-fired central heating (Upgraded 5 years ago)\n• Double glazed windows throughout and composite front door\n• Mature and highly sought-after location\n• Excellent transport links nearby\n• Walking distance to Finglas Village\n• Close to National Botanic Gardens, Albert College Park and Johnstown Park\n• Nearby Na Fianna GAA Club, Glasnevin Lawn Tennis Club and Tolka Rovers AFC\n• Easy access to Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, the M50 and Dublin Airport\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, families and investors alike"
      },
      {
